openai_raw_latex:
\begin{claim}
  \label{clmcorrect} Assume \mathsf{GCH}.
  One can force $\mathfrak{gp}=\lambda$ whenever $\lambda>{\rm cf(\lambda)=\omega_1$.
  Moreover, this statement has no consistency strength.
\end{claim}

